.el .ds Aq '
.TH ckman-piv-keys-move 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-piv\-keys\-move \- Move a key from one slot to another (certificate stays in place)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-piv\-keys\-move\fR [\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-management\-key\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISOURCE\fR> <\fIDEST\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Move a key from one slot to another (certificate stays in place)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-management\-key\fR \fI<MANAGEMENT_KEY>\fR
Current management key as 48 hex characters (prompted when needed)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISOURCE\fR>
Source slot
.TP
<\fIDEST\fR>
Destination slot
